@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Law on Insurance Business 08/2022/QH15 (Luật Kinh doanh bảo hiểm), whole Act, three vintages.
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Sources (the gazette texts; no consolidation was given): law08-2022-qh15.txt (Điều 1-130),
-- law08-2022-qh15-577-578.txt (Điều 131-157), law139-2025-qh15.txt (the amending Law).
-- A `src:N` comment quotes line N of law08-2022-qh15.txt, `src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:N` and
-- `src:law139-2025-qh15:N` the other two. These lines are GENERATED by tools/expand.py from
-- templates/*.l4.in using tools/vnsrc.py; nothing in Vietnamese here is typed by hand.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER. A period counted in days is a count of days;
-- which kind of day the Law means is a fork (NOTES.md section 3, fork F1).
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact,
-- or a document (the contract, a notice, a licence) records it. Whether the fact makes anything
-- lawful, void or payable is a rule and belongs in the module of the article that says so.
-- This module holds the nouns of Chuong I-II (Dieu 1-61) and, as they were needed, of the rest.

§ `Nouns for Law 08/2022/QH15`

§§ `The kinds of insurance, of contract and of insurer`

-- Dieu 7(1): the three types (loai hinh) of insurance.
@@q 218 222
@ref Dieu 7 (src:218-222)
DECLARE `A type of insurance` IS ONE OF
    `life insurance`
    `health insurance`
    `non-life insurance`

-- Dieu 15(1): the five classes of insurance contract. The last paragraph of Dieu 15(1) puts
-- property, damage and liability contracts into the non-life type.
@@q 370 377
@ref Dieu 15 (src:370-377)
DECLARE `A class of insurance contract` IS ONE OF
    `a life insurance contract`
    `a health insurance contract`
    `a property insurance contract`
    `a damage insurance contract`
    `a liability insurance contract`

-- Dieu 4(17)-(20) and (23): the kinds of insurer the Law names. Dieu 4(17) says an insurer
-- "bao gom" life, non-life and health insurers; reinsurers, foreign branches and mutual
-- organisations are the other holders of a licence the Law mentions in Dieu 4(2), 4(3), 4(5).
@@q 138 144
@@q 145 147
@@q 148 155
@@q 161 166
@ref Dieu 4 (src:138-155; src:161-166)
DECLARE `A kind of insurer` IS ONE OF
    `a life insurer`
    `a non-life insurer`
    `a health insurer`
    `a reinsurer`
    `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`
    `a branch of a foreign reinsurer`
    `a microinsurance mutual organisation`

-- Dieu 4(1): the activities that make up insurance business activity.
@@q 65 68
@ref Dieu 4 (src:65-68)
DECLARE `A kind of insurance business activity` IS ONE OF
    `insurance business`
    `reinsurance business`
    `ceding of reinsurance`
    `insurance agency activity`
    `insurance brokerage activity`
    `an ancillary insurance service`

-- Dieu 17(1)(a) and 4(24)-(26): the people on a contract. What a witness can say about a
-- person is whether they are an organisation, and which of the four statuses of Dieu 25(1)(e),
-- 39(2) and 41 they have. The statuses are as at the date the contract was made.
@@q 603 605
@@q 808 814
@ref Dieu 25, 39 (src:603-605; src:808-814)
DECLARE `A person` HAS
    `is an organisation`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a minor`                                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `has lost civil act capacity`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `has limited civil act capacity`                           IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Dieu 4: facts about an enterprise and about an activity`

-- Dieu 4(17), (18), (19), (20), (21), (23): what makes an enterprise one of the kinds. Each
-- flag is a fact an applicant's papers or a licence record.
@@q 138 140
@@q 145 147
@@q 148 151
@@q 152 155
@@q 156 158
@@q 161 166
@ref Dieu 4 (src:138-140; src:145-158; src:161-166)
DECLARE `An enterprise` HAS
    `established, organised and operating under this Law and other related laws` IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates to carry on insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates to carry on reinsurance business and ceding`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates to carry on insurance brokerage activity`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `carries on life insurance`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `carries on non-life insurance`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `carries on health insurance`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a legal person`                                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a dependent unit of a foreign insurer or reinsurer`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign insurer or reinsurer guarantees and answers for all its obligations in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
    `keeps independent accounts`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `was founded by members or a body representing members`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates without a profit purpose, for mutual support among members`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `is voluntary, financially autonomous and answerable only within the assets formed from microinsurance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign body is a non-life insurer`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign body is a reinsurer`                                            IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 4(2)-(12): an activity, described by who carries it on and what it does. The flags are
-- what a witness to the activity could say.
@@q 69 75
@@q 78 83
@@q 84 89
@@q 90 95
@@q 96 100
@ref Dieu 4 (src:69-100)
DECLARE `An activity` HAS
    `carried on by`                                                              IS A `A kind of insurer`
    `carried on by an insurer, a reinsurer or a branch of a foreign insurer or reinsurer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `carried on by an agent, a broker or an ancillary service provider`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `accepts the risk of the insured person`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder pays premium for it`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `pays on the insured event as the contract agrees`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `receives a reinsurance premium from another insurer, reinsurer, branch, foreign insurer, foreign reinsurer or foreign insurance organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `undertakes to compensate for the liabilities taken`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `transfers part of the liability taken in reinsurance to another insurer, reinsurer, branch or foreign body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pays a ceding premium for the transfer`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `acts under the authorisation of an insurer, a branch or a mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `advises on insurance products`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `introduces insurance products`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `offers insurance products for sale`                                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `arranges the making of insurance contracts`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `collects premium`                                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `collects dossiers for claims settlement`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `provides information and advice to the policyholder on types, products, programmes, terms, premium or insurers` IS A BOOLEAN
    `negotiates, arranges the making of or performs insurance or reinsurance contracts` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 4(7)-(12): the ancillary services.
@@q 101 106
@@q 107 108
@@q 111 113
@@q 114 118
@@q 119 121
@@q 122 125
@ref Dieu 4 (src:101-125)
DECLARE `An ancillary activity` HAS
    `is advice on insurance programmes, products, risk management or loss prevention` IS A BOOLEAN
    `identifies, classifies and assesses the nature and degree of insurable risk`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `collects and analyses statistics, computes premium, reserves, capital or solvency` IS A BOOLEAN
    `determines the condition, cause and extent of a loss and apportions liability` IS A BOOLEAN
    `helps a policyholder, insured person, beneficiary or insurer with claims procedures` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done by the insurer, reinsurer, branch or mutual organisation itself for its own business` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 4(13)-(15), (22): what a product covers.
@@q 126 131
@@q 159 160
@ref Dieu 4 (src:126-131; src:159-160)
DECLARE `A cover` HAS
    `covers the insured person living or dying`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `covers injury, accident, illness, disease or health care`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `covers damage to property and other losses`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `covers civil liability to a third person`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `is directed at low-income individuals or households`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `protects against risks to life, health and property`                        IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 4(16), (24)-(29): the contract and its parties, in the terms of Dieu 4.
@@q 167 169
@@q 170 172
@@q 175 177
@ref Dieu 4 (src:167-177)
DECLARE `A role in a contract` HAS
    `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pays the insurance premium`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` IS A BOOLEAN

@@q 178 181
@ref Dieu 4 (src:178-181)
DECLARE `An occurrence` HAS
    `is an objective event`                                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `was agreed by the parties or is provided by law`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `obliges the insurer, branch or mutual organisation to compensate or pay under the contract when it occurs` IS A BOOLEAN

@@q 182 185
@ref Dieu 4 (src:182-185)
DECLARE `A payment` HAS
    `is made by the policyholder to the insurer, branch or mutual organisation`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `is required by law or agreed by the parties in the contract`                IS A BOOLEAN

@@q 132 137
@@q 186 190
@ref Dieu 4 (src:132-137; src:186-190)
DECLARE `A contract arrangement` HAS
    `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder must pay premium under it`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Chuong I: scope, application, compulsory insurance, prohibited acts, data and online supply`

-- Dieu 1(2): the schemes the Law does not apply to.
@@q 30 31
@ref Dieu 1 (src:30-31)
DECLARE `An insurance scheme` HAS
    `is social insurance`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `is health insurance`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `is deposit insurance`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `is another kind of insurance the State provides without a business character` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 3(1): a law made after the Law took effect that wants to differ from it.
@@q 50 56
@ref Dieu 3 (src:50-56)
DECLARE `A later law` HAS
    `was issued after the Law took effect`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `differs on a matter Dieu 3(1) lists`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `states specifically which content is applied or not applied under this Law` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 3(2): an agreement to apply international custom.
@@q 57 62
@ref Dieu 3 (src:57-62)
DECLARE `An agreement to apply international custom` HAS
    `the contract is one of insurance, reinsurance or brokerage` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the parties agreed to apply the custom`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `at least one party is a foreign organisation or individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    `all parties are Vietnamese organisations or citizens`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the object of insurance or the performance of the contract is abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
    `applying the custom would be contrary to the basic principles of Vietnamese law` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 3(3), added by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(1): the right to contribute capital.
@@qa 26 30
@ref Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1 (src:law139-2025-qh15:26-30)
DECLARE `A would-be investor` HAS
    `the target is an insurer, reinsurer, broker, mutual organisation or foreign branch` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has no right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 6(1): taking insurance in Vietnam.
@@q 208 213
@ref Dieu 6 (src:208-213)
DECLARE `A purchase of insurance` HAS
    `the buyer is an organisation or individual in Vietnam`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the seller holds a licence to establish and operate in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurance is a cross-border service under an international treaty to which Vietnam is a member` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 6(2): the cross-border services the Government is to regulate.
@@q 214 217
@ref Dieu 6 (src:214-217)
DECLARE `A cross-border service` IS ONE OF
    `cross-border insurance`
    `cross-border insurance brokerage`
    `cross-border ancillary insurance service`

-- Dieu 8: compulsory insurance.
@@q 226 245
@ref Dieu 8 (src:226-245)
DECLARE `A product for the purposes of compulsory insurance` HAS
    `protects the public interest, the environment and social safety` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `is compulsory fire and explosion insurance`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `is insurance in construction investment activity`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `is insurance in construction activity`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `is compulsory under another law and meets Dieu 8(1)`    IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A sale of compulsory insurance` HAS
    `the buyer is within the class that must buy it`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the seller is permitted to offer it`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the buyer meets the conditions the law sets for buying` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the seller refused to sell`                             IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 9: an act that is prohibited. One flag per limb of Dieu 9(1)-(5).
@@q 246 261
@ref Dieu 9 (src:246-261)
DECLARE `An act in insurance business` HAS
    `is insurance, reinsurance, ceding or brokerage business`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done without a licence to establish and operate`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done outside the scope of the licence`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `is insurance agency activity`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an ancillary insurance service`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor does not meet the conditions of law to do it`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `is colluding with a beneficiary to settle a claim unlawfully` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is forging documents or deliberately falsifying information in a claim dossier` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is forging documents or deliberately falsifying information to refuse a claim after the insured event` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is causing loss to one's own property or health to get insurance benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is threatening or coercing the making of an insurance contract` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 11(2)-(3): supplying and using database information.
@@q 279 292
@ref Dieu 11 (src:279-292)
DECLARE `A use of database information` HAS
    `the supplier is an insurer, reinsurer, branch, broker, ancillary provider or mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `supplied information on the policyholder, insured person, object, agent and other related information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `ensured confidentiality`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `ensured information safety`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `ensured cybersecurity`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `complied with the law on privacy, personal, family and business secrets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `used the information for the purpose supplied`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `gave it to a third party`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `a law provides for the supply`                          IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 13: an information technology system.
@@q 321 333
@ref Dieu 13 (src:321-333)
DECLARE `An information technology system` HAS
    `has servers, software and technical solutions to update, count, process and store information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `meets cybersecurity requirements`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `meets network information safety requirements`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `eases the running, risk control and supervision`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `has disaster recovery and continuity solutions`         IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 14: offering insurance online.
@@q 335 358
@ref Dieu 14 (src:335-358)
DECLARE `An online offer` HAS
    `the offeror is an insurer, branch or mutual organisation`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offeror is an insurance agent`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offeror is an insurance broker`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offer is within the scope of the agency contract`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder's rights were affected`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract party gave truthful and accurate information as Dieu 22 requires` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Chuong III, Muc 1: forms, content of activity and classes an insurer may carry on`

-- Dieu 62: the forms an insurer or reinsurer may take.
@@q 1135 1138
@ref Dieu 62 (src:1135-1138)
DECLARE `A form of organisation` IS ONE OF
    `a joint stock company`
    `a limited liability company`
    `another form of organisation`

-- Dieu 63(1)-(2): the lines of activity.
@@q 1139 1153
@ref Dieu 63 (src:1139-1153)
DECLARE `A line of activity` IS ONE OF
    `insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding`
    `managing funds and investing capital from insurance business`
    `supplying ancillary insurance services`
    `another activity directly related to insurance business`
    `reinsurance business and ceding`
    `managing funds and investing capital from reinsurance business`
    `another activity directly related to reinsurance business`

-- Dieu 63(3): a product an insurer offers, for the test of the one-type rule and its exceptions.
@@q 1154 1163
@ref Dieu 63 (src:1154-1163)
DECLARE `A product offered` HAS
    `type of insurance`                                      IS A `A type of insurance`
    `term in months`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `covers the risk of death`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a term-life product`                                 IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `The business of an insurer` HAS
    `kind of insurer`                                        IS A `A kind of insurer`
    `products offered`                                       IS A LIST OF `A product offered`

§§ `Chuong VII: commencement and transition`

-- Dieu 156(2): the provisions whose commencement is deferred (V1: all on 1 January 2028; V2: the second
-- group on 1 January 2031, Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(14)(a)).
@@qb 528 530
@@qa 292 295
@ref Dieu 156 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:528-530; src:law139-2025-qh15:292-295)
DECLARE `A provision with a deferred commencement` IS ONE OF
    `Dieu 86(3)`
    `Dieu 94(4) and (5)`
    `Dieu 95`
    `Dieu 99(3) and (4)`
    `Dieu 109`
    `Dieu 110`
    `Dieu 111`
    `Dieu 112`
    `Dieu 113`
    `Dieu 114`
    `Dieu 116`

-- Dieu 156(3): the provisions of Law 24/2000/QH10 (as amended by Laws 61/2010/QH12 and 42/2019/QH14)
-- that survive the commencement for a time.
@@qb 531 537
@@qa 297 304
@ref Dieu 156 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:531-537; src:law139-2025-qh15:297-304)
DECLARE `A provision of the old Law 24/2000/QH10` IS ONE OF
    `old Dieu 77`
    `old Dieu 78`
    `old Dieu 79`
    `old Dieu 80`
    `old Dieu 81`
    `old Dieu 83`
    `old Dieu 94`
    `old Dieu 97`
    `old Dieu 98`
    `an old provision not listed in Dieu 156(3)`

-- Dieu 157(1): which text governs a contract made before the commencement.
@@qb 539 543
@ref Dieu 157 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:539-543)
DECLARE `A governing text` IS ONE OF
    `the law in force when the contract was made`
    `Law 08/2022/QH15`

DECLARE `A contract made before the commencement` HAS
    `date the contract was made`                             IS A DATE
    `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the parties agreed to amend it to conform to this Law and to apply this Law` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 157(2)-(3): certificates issued before the commencement.
@@qb 544 549
@@qa 312 317
@ref Dieu 157 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:544-549; src:law139-2025-qh15:312-317)
DECLARE `A kind of certificate issued before the commencement` IS ONE OF
    `an insurance agent certificate`
    `an insurance certificate`
    `an insurance broker certificate`
    `an ancillary insurance certificate`

-- Dieu 155: the Investment Law Appendix IV lines the Law lists as conditional.
@@qb 516 522
@ref Dieu 155 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:516-522)
DECLARE `A business line of the Investment Law Appendix IV` IS ONE OF
    `insurance brokerage`
    `ancillary insurance services`

§§ `Chuong III, Muc 4-5: products, premium methods, outsourcing, transfer of portfolios`

-- Dieu 87(2): the requirements on rules, terms and premium rates an insurer builds.
@@q 1760 1775
@ref Dieu 87 (src:1760-1775)
DECLARE `Rules, terms and rates` HAS
    `comply with the law and fit Vietnamese practice, ethics, culture and custom` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the language of the rules and terms is accurate, simple and easy to understand and technical terms are defined` IS A BOOLEAN
    `state clearly insurable interest, object, scope and risks, the rights and duties of the policyholder and insured person, the insurer's liability, exclusions, the method of paying and the dispute provisions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium is built on statistics, corresponds to the conditions and liability and ensures solvency` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 87(3) and (3a): the lines of product whose premium method needs the Ministry of Finance.
@@q 1776 1782
@@qa 165 178
@ref Dieu 87 (src:1776-1782; src:law139-2025-qh15:165-178)
DECLARE `A product line for premium rules` IS ONE OF
    `a life insurance product`
    `a health insurance product`
    `a voluntary motor vehicle insurance product`
    `compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners`
    `another non-life insurance product`

DECLARE `A premium method` HAS
    `product line`                                           IS A `A product line for premium rules`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer applies the method it notified`             IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 87(4): the ways an insurer may supply products.
@@q 1783 1789
@ref Dieu 87 (src:1783-1789)
DECLARE `A way of supplying insurance products` IS ONE OF
    `directly`
    `through an insurance agent or broker`
    `through a tender`
    `through an electronic transaction`
    `another way the law allows`

-- Dieu 89(2): who may take part in co-insurance.
@@q 1829 1837
@ref Dieu 89 (src:1829-1837)
DECLARE `A would-be co-insurer` HAS
    `is an insurer or a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a licence to establish and operate under this Law`  IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 90: outsourcing.
@@q 1857 1925
@ref Dieu 90 (src:1857-1925)
DECLARE `An outsourcing` HAS
    `the outsourced activity is internal control`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the outsourced activity is internal audit`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the outsourced activity is risk management`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the outsourced activity is advising on, introducing or offering insurance products or arranging the making of insurance contracts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `share of the value of the work the provider performs itself` IS A NUMBER
    `part of the work is subcontracted`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer consented to the subcontract in writing in advance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the outsourcing contract is in writing`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states scope and content`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states time and place`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the rights and obligations of both sides` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states quality standards and requirements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the provider's duty to give information and report` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the contingency, remedy and compensation if the provider cannot or does not perform` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the mechanism to supervise, control and audit, and separate accounting` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract restricts subcontracting`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the mechanism to keep data and customer information confidential` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the way of resolving disputes`      IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 91-93: a transfer of a portfolio of contracts.
@@q 1931 1977
@ref Dieu 91-93 (src:1931-1977)
DECLARE `A portfolio transfer` HAS
    `the Ministry of Finance required it under Dieu 113(8)(c) or (d)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it narrows the content or scope of activity`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `it follows a division, split, merger, consolidation, dissolution or cessation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it follows a revocation under Dieu 75(1)(a), (d) or (e)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the receiving insurer is already carrying on the line transferred` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the receiving insurer meets the capital adequacy ratio and solvency requirements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the receiving insurer meets the conditions to run the line after receipt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `value of the assets transferred`                        IS A NUMBER
    `technical reserve of the whole portfolio transferred`   IS A NUMBER
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the Ministry of Finance approved`                  IS A DATE
    `date the transferor published and notified the policyholders` IS A DATE

§§ `Chuong III, Muc 6: capital, deposit, reserves, investment, separation of sources, audit, reports`

-- Dieu 94(3)-(5), 95: the capital of an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch (VND).
@@q 1984 2026
@ref Dieu 94-95 (src:1984-2026)
DECLARE `The capital of an insurer` HAS
    `charter capital paid up`                                IS A NUMBER
    `capital allocated to a foreign branch`                  IS A NUMBER
    `reserve funds`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `undistributed after-tax profit`                         IS A NUMBER
    `funds of the owner set aside from after-tax profit`     IS A NUMBER
    `other sources the Ministry of Finance allows to be recognised`  IS A NUMBER
    `amounts the Ministry of Finance requires to be deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `amount invested in other insurers, other reinsurers and subsidiaries of insurers and reinsurers` IS A NUMBER
    `risk-based capital`                                     IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 96: the deposit.
@@q 2027 2043
@ref Dieu 96 (src:2027-2043)
DECLARE `A deposit` HAS
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS A NUMBER
    `amount deposited`                                       IS A NUMBER
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the deposit was used`                              IS A DATE
    `date the deposit used was replenished`                  IS A DATE
    `the business has ceased`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn`                   IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 97: technical reserves.
@@q 2044 2065
@ref Dieu 97 (src:2044-2065)
DECLARE `A technical reserve` HAS
    `set aside separately for each line of insurance`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
    `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
    `computed and set aside using the actuary`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 98: the compulsory reserve fund.
@@q 2070 2080
@ref Dieu 98 (src:2070-2080)
DECLARE `A reserve fund position` HAS
    `after-tax profit of the year`                           IS A NUMBER
    `balance of the compulsory reserve fund`                 IS A NUMBER
    `maximum the Government fixes for the compulsory reserve fund` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- Dieu 99-100: an investment position.
@@q 2081 2172
@ref Dieu 99-100 (src:2081-2172)
DECLARE `An investment position` HAS
    `total investment capital`                               IS A NUMBER
    `amount invested in companies of one group with mutual ownership, other than deposits at credit institutions and establishing an enterprise or a branch abroad` IS A NUMBER
    `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the investment is funded by borrowing, or entrusted to invest in securities, real estate or equity in other enterprises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `reinvested in shareholders, members or their related persons, other than deposits at a credit institution that is a shareholder or member` IS A BOOLEAN
    `bought corporate bonds issued to restructure the issuer's own debts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `entrusted investment is with a licensed trustee for that line` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is entrusted investment`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `is real estate business outside the exceptions`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `years real estate has been held after foreclosure or set-off` IS A NUMBER
    `is real estate held after foreclosure or set-off of debts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is precious metals or stones`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `is intangible fixed assets not serving the insurance business` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is derivatives other than listed hedging derivatives`   IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `An investment abroad` HAS
    `is establishing, funding or buying an insurer or reinsurer abroad, or a branch, representative office or other presence abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is buying or selling securities or investing through funds or intermediaries abroad as the Government provides` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is funded from equity left after capital adequacy and solvency` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is funded from idle technical reserves of contracts linked to foreign investment indices or made with persons abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
    `keeps the capital adequacy ratio and solvency`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `complies with the insurance, investment and foreign exchange laws` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is made in the name of the insurer or reinsurer`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `is managed and tracked separately`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `covers a loss of the investment with money or assets of domestic policyholders` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing before the investment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the investor is a foreign branch in Vietnam`            IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 101: separating the sources of capital and premium (amended by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(8)).
@@q 2173 2195
@@qa 188 220
@ref Dieu 101 (src:2173-2195; src:law139-2025-qh15:188-220)
DECLARE `A separation of sources` HAS
    `kind of insurer`                                        IS A `A kind of insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a participating life contract portfolio`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS A BOOLEAN
    `follows the registered or notified principles`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 103: the financial year.
@@q 2202 2208
@ref Dieu 103 (src:2202-2208)
DECLARE `A financial year` HAS
    `date the licence was granted`                           IS A DATE
    `calendar year asked about`                              IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 105-107: audit, reports, transfer of profit abroad.
@@q 2213 2271
@ref Dieu 105-107 (src:2213-2271)
DECLARE `The audits and reports of an insurer` HAS
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sent the report on insurance operations`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sent the solvency and risk management report`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS A BOOLEAN
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance`   IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` HAS
    `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is assets belonging to foreign investors left after ending business in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
    `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Chuong III, Muc 7-9: financial safety, supervisory measures, dissolution, bankruptcy, disclosure`

-- Dieu 109-110: financial safety and solvency.
@@q 2289 2308
@ref Dieu 109-110 (src:2289-2308)
DECLARE `A financial safety position` HAS
    `meets the rules on capital`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `meets the rules on solvency`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `meets the rules on investment`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `has set aside technical reserves in full`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `has assured the capital adequacy ratio`                 IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 111-113: improvement, early intervention and control.
@@q 2311 2468
@ref Dieu 111-113 (src:2311-2468)
DECLARE `A supervisory measure` HAS
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires early intervention` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires control` IS A BOOLEAN
    `improvement measures were applied for 12 continuous months without restoring the ratio` IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of the Ministry of Finance's order`                IS A DATE
    `date the insurer built and reported its remedial plan`  IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the insurer hired an independent auditor`          IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the ratio was restored`                            IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the restoration was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a control measure has been applied`                     IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `An activity during a supervisory measure` HAS
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS A BOOLEAN
    `takes on more reinsurance`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `buys back its own shares`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 115: dissolution of an insurer, ending of a foreign branch.
@@q 2483 2501
@ref Dieu 115 (src:2483-2501)
DECLARE `A dissolution` HAS
    `the enterprise asked voluntarily`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the term of operation in the licence has ended`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the licence was revoked under Dieu 75(1)(a), (b), (d) or (e)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a foreign branch did not restore the ratio after the period of control` IS A BOOLEAN
    `another case the law provides`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing`            IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 116: bankruptcy. The five ranks of claim in order, in VND.
@@q 2502 2535
@ref Dieu 116 (src:2502-2535)
DECLARE `A bankruptcy distribution` HAS
    `assets to be divided`                                   IS A NUMBER
    `bankruptcy costs`                                       IS A NUMBER
    `wages, severance, social and health insurance owed to employees` IS A NUMBER
    `claims for compensation or payment already accepted, surrender values, account values or premium refunds` IS A NUMBER
    `obligations to the State, unsecured debts on the list, and secured debts not covered by the security` IS A NUMBER
    `claims of the owners, members and shareholders`         IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `A rank in bankruptcy` IS ONE OF
    `costs of bankruptcy`
    `employees`
    `accepted insurance claims, surrender values and premium refunds`
    `State, unsecured creditors and under-secured creditors`
    `owners, members and shareholders`

-- Dieu 117-120: disclosure of information.
@@q 2542 2622
@ref Dieu 117-120 (src:2542-2622)
DECLARE `A kind of information to disclose` IS ONE OF
    `periodic information (Dieu 118)`
    `regular information (Dieu 119)`
    `unusual information (Dieu 120)`

DECLARE `A disclosure event` HAS
    `kind`                                                   IS A `A kind of information to disclose`
    `date the period for sending the report ended, or the event occurred` IS A DATE
    `date the information was published on the insurer's website` IS A DATE
    `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance of what it published` IS A DATE
    `the insurer is a public company`                        IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A loss of property` HAS
    `value of the loss`                                      IS A NUMBER
    `owners' equity`                                         IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `A transfer of shares` HAS
    `holding before as a share of charter capital`           IS A NUMBER
    `holding after as a share of charter capital`            IS A NUMBER

§§ `Chuong III, Muc 1-2: licence, ownership, governance, officers`

-- Dieu 64-66: the people who found an insurer or reinsurer and the shape of its ownership.
@@q 1166 1179
