    `second principal`                                       IS A `A kind of insurer`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on`      IS A LIST OF `A type of insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on`     IS A LIST OF `A type of insurance`

DECLARE `Two engagements of an organisation agent` HAS
    `the first principal agreed in writing to the second engagement` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 127(3)-(5).
@@q 2750 2759
@ref Dieu 127 (src:2750-2759)
DECLARE `An agent's practice` HAS
    `acts only on products the agent was trained on`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agent's data is registered and kept current in the insurance database` IS A BOOLEAN
