    `prevented the policyholder from giving information or urged the policyholder not to declare it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `took customers by obstructing, luring, bribing or threatening staff or customers of an insurer, agent or broker` IS A BOOLEAN
    `urged a customer to cancel a contract in force`         IS A BOOLEAN

