    `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully and meets the financial conditions the Government sets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an organisation`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `is established under foreign law and holds 10% or more of charter capital` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has itself or through a subsidiary run insurance brokerage for the latest 5 consecutive years` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a foreign authority allowed it to found the broker and confirmed no serious breach in the latest 3 consecutive years` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A broker licence application` HAS
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `charter capital`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets`            IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a chair, a chief executive and a legal representative expected to meet Dieu 138` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has an organisational form this Law provides and a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the written application`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the draft charter`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the 5-year operating plan`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the CVs, criminal records and qualifications of the proposed officers` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the capital contribution, the list of holders of 10% or more and proof they meet Dieu 133` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 136: changes to a broker.
@@qb 101 125
@ref Dieu 136 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:101-125)
DECLARE `A change to a broker` IS ONE OF
    `a change of name or of head office address`
    `a change of charter capital`
    `a change of content, scope or term of activity`
    `a transfer of shares taking a holder to or above 10%, or below 10%`
    `a change of the chair or the chief executive`
    `a division, split, merger, consolidation, dissolution, change of form, or opening a branch or other presence abroad`
    `a change of the charter`
    `opening, ending or moving a branch or representative office`

-- Dieu 137(3): conduct of a broker.
@@qb 150 164
@ref Dieu 137 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:150-164)
DECLARE `The conduct of a broker` HAS
    `prevented a policyholder from giving information or urged the policyholder not to declare it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `promoted by promising unlawful benefits to urge a customer to contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `urged a policyholder to cancel a contract in force to buy a new one` IS A BOOLEAN
    `advised buying from an insurer on less competitive terms to earn higher commission` IS A BOOLEAN
    `gave the customer false or unsuitable information on an insurer's terms` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 138: personnel, capital, investment of a broker.
@@qb 165 200
@@qa 243 250
@ref Dieu 138 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:165-200; src:law139-2025-qh15:243-250)
DECLARE `The finances of a broker` HAS
    `person who directly brokers has a degree in insurance or an insurance or broker certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `charter capital`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `owners' equity`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets`            IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `investment is safe, liquid and efficient, lawful, and at its own risk` IS A BOOLEAN
    `invested in shareholders, members or their related persons, other than deposits at a credit institution that is a shareholder or member` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 140: who supplies ancillary services to whom.
@@qb 218 233
@ref Dieu 140 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:218-233)
DECLARE `A provider of ancillary services` IS ONE OF
    `an insurer or a foreign non-life branch`
    `an insurance broker`
    `another organisation with legal personality`
    `an individual`

DECLARE `A recipient of ancillary services` IS ONE OF
    `an insurer, reinsurer, foreign branch, broker or mutual organisation`
    `another organisation or individual`

DECLARE `A kind of ancillary service` IS ONE OF
    `advice`
    `another ancillary service`

-- Dieu 142: restrictions on ancillary providers.
@@qb 243 258
@ref Dieu 142 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:243-258)
DECLARE `The position of an ancillary provider` HAS
    `provider is a broker that arranged the making of the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `provides loss adjustment on that contract`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `provider is also the policyholder, insured person or beneficiary under the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `provides loss adjustment or claims support on that contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has bought professional liability insurance suited to the service` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an individual giving advice`                         IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 143 (V1 and V2; repealed by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(8) from V3).
@@qb 259 286
@@qa 339 339
@ref Dieu 143 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:259-286; src:law139-2025-qh15:339)
DECLARE `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` HAS
    `is an individual giving advice`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `has full civil act capacity`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in insurance`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in another field and an ancillary insurance certificate for advice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an organisation with legal personality, lawfully established and operating` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its staff directly doing ancillary work have full capacity and suitable degrees or certificates` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its loss adjusters also meet the standards of an assessor under commercial law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its actuaries also meet the conditions for an actuary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a loss adjustment organisation`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an actuarial organisation`                           IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Chuong V: microinsurance`

-- Dieu 144: the characteristics of a microinsurance product.
@@qb 291 302
@ref Dieu 144 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:291-302)
DECLARE `A microinsurance product` HAS
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS A BOOLEAN
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `term in years`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `sum insured per contract`                               IS A NUMBER
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract`        IS A NUMBER
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- Dieu 145-150: premium method, providers, mutual organisations.
@@qb 304 405
@ref Dieu 145-150 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:304-405)
DECLARE `A supplier of microinsurance` HAS
    `is an insurer or foreign non-life branch licensed in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a mutual organisation licensed in Vietnam`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered the premium method and the Ministry of Finance approved it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `keeps revenue and cost of microinsurance separate from other activity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `supplies only to its own members`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the buyer is both a member and an owner`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `all profit is used for the members' benefit`            IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A mutual organisation applicant` HAS
    `founder is a Vietnamese citizen of full capacity who is a member of the organisation planning it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `founder is an organisation representing members as the law provides` IS A BOOLEAN
    `founding capital is in Vietnamese dong`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `founding capital`                                       IS A NUMBER
    `minimum founding capital the Government sets`           IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and a microinsurance actuary expected to meet the Government's conditions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a plan to supply microinsurance fitting its members and network` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a draft charter fitting its aims and the Government's rules` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a suitable information technology system`           IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A class of contract of a mutual organisation` IS ONE OF
    `the general rules on insurance contracts`
    `life insurance contracts`
    `health insurance contracts`
    `property insurance contracts`
    `damage insurance contracts`
    `liability insurance contracts`

§§ `Chuong VI: State management`

@@qb 437 456
@ref Dieu 152 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:437-456)
DECLARE `A proposed enterprise name` HAS
    `contains the words bao hiem or tai bao hiem or a term that could be mistaken for an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch` IS A BOOLEAN
    `contains the words moi gioi bao hiem or moi gioi tai bao hiem or a term that could be mistaken for an insurance broker` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the applicant is an insurer, reinsurer, foreign branch or mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the applicant is an insurance broker`                   IS A BOOLEAN

@@qb 478 483
@ref Dieu 153 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:478-483)
DECLARE `A provision cited in Dieu 153(1)(c)` IS ONE OF
    `Dieu 95`
    `Dieu 99`
    `Dieu 100`
    `Dieu 109`
    `Dieu 110`

-- Dieu 154(2): the topics on which the regulator may hire independent opinion.
@@qb 494 509
@ref Dieu 154 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:494-509)
DECLARE `A topic for independent opinion` IS ONE OF
    `technical reserves`
    `solvency`
    `reinsurance`
    `investment`
    `separating owners' equity from premium sources and distributing surplus`
    `rules, terms and premium rates`


DECLARE `A State oversight function` IS ONE OF
    `inspection (thanh tra)`
    `specialised examination (kiem tra chuyen nganh)`

§§ `Chuong II: the contract of insurance`

-- Dieu 15, 17, 18, 25, 28, 42: the contract as made. Dates are calendar dates.
@@q 369 386
@ref Dieu 15 (src:369-386)
DECLARE `A contract of insurance` HAS
    `class of contract`                                      IS A `A class of insurance contract`
    `insurer`                                                IS A `A kind of insurer`
    `policyholder`                                           IS A `A person`
    `insured person`                                         IS A `A person`
    `is a group contract`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a maritime insurance contract`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the contract was made`                             IS A DATE
    `date the policyholder received the contract`            IS A DATE
    `first day of the insurance term`                        IS A DATE
    `last day of the insurance term`                         IS A DATE
    `sum insured`                                            IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 15(3)-(4): which instrument fills the contract's gaps.
@@q 382 386
@ref Dieu 15 (src:382-386)
DECLARE `A governing instrument` IS ONE OF
    `the Maritime Code`
    `this Law`
    `the Civil Code`

-- Dieu 15(2): the classes a contract combines.
@@q 378 381
@ref Dieu 15 (src:378-381)
DECLARE `A combination of classes` HAS
    `classes combined`                                       IS A LIST OF `A class of insurance contract`

-- Dieu 17(1): the essential contents. One flag per limb, in the Law's order (a)-(i).
@@q 409 422
@ref Dieu 17 (src:409-422)
DECLARE `The contents of a contract` HAS
    `states the policyholder, the insured person, the beneficiary if any and the insurer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the object of insurance`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the sum insured or the value of insured property or the limit of liability` IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the scope or benefits of insurance and the rules, conditions and terms`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the rights and obligations of the insurer and the policyholder`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the insurance term and when the contract takes effect`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the premium and the method of paying it`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the method of paying compensation or the insurance money`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the method of resolving disputes`                                           IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 18: the form and the evidence.
@@q 427 430
@ref Dieu 18 (src:427-430)
DECLARE `The form of a contract` HAS
    `is made in writing`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidenced by the contract itself`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidenced by a certificate of insurance`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidenced by an insurance application or policy`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidenced by another form the law provides`             IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 16(3): the compensation a claim comes to, against the loss.
@@q 399 401
@ref Dieu 16 (src:399-401)
DECLARE `A compensation` HAS
    `compensation`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `actual loss in the insured event`                       IS A NUMBER
    `the contract agrees otherwise`                          IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 19: an exclusion clause and its handling.
@@q 431 444
@ref Dieu 19 (src:431-444)
DECLARE `An exclusion clause` HAS
    `the contract has an exclusion clause`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the exclusion clearly`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer explained the exclusion clearly and fully`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is evidence the policyholder was given the explanation and understood it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the exclusion is for late notice`                                       IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 20(1) and 21(1): the rights, and Dieu 20(2) and 21(2): the duties, one constructor per limb.
@@q 447 465
@ref Dieu 20 (src:447-465)
DECLARE `A right of the insurer` IS ONE OF
    `to collect premium as the contract agrees`                                        -- (a)
    `to require the policyholder to give full and truthful information`                -- (b)
    `to rescind under Dieu 22(2) or terminate unilaterally under Dieu 26`              -- (c)
    `to refuse to pay when outside the insurance liability or excluded`                -- (d)
    `to require loss prevention and limitation measures`                               -- (dd)
    `to require a third person to reimburse what it paid`                              -- (e)
    `another right the law gives`                                                      -- (g)

@@q 466 489
@ref Dieu 20 (src:466-489)
DECLARE `A duty of the insurer` IS ONE OF
    `to give the policyholder the application, questionnaire, object details and rules, conditions and terms` -- (a)
    `to explain benefits, exclusions and the policyholder's rights and duties clearly and fully`        -- (b)
    `to give the policyholder the evidence of the contract`                            -- (c)
    `to issue a receipt for premium`                                                   -- (d)
    `to compensate or pay when the insured event occurs`                               -- (dd)
    `to explain a refusal to pay in writing`                                           -- (e)
    `to cooperate with the policyholder on a third person's claim`                     -- (g)
    `to keep the contract records as the law provides`                                 -- (h)
    `to keep the policyholder's and insured person's information confidential`         -- (i)
    `another duty the law gives`                                                       -- (k)

@@q 490 511
@ref Dieu 21 (src:490-511)
DECLARE `A right of the policyholder` IS ONE OF
    `to choose the insurer`                                                            -- (a)
    `to ask for the application, questionnaire, object details and terms and for their explanation` -- (b)
    `to ask for the evidence of the contract`                                          -- (c)
    `to ask for a receipt for premium`                                                 -- (d)
    `to rescind under Dieu 22(3) and Dieu 35 or terminate unilaterally under Dieu 26`  -- (dd)
    `to ask the insurer to compensate or pay when the insured event occurs`            -- (e)
    `to transfer the contract`                                                         -- (g)
    `another right the law gives`                                                      -- (h)

@@q 512 534
@ref Dieu 21 (src:512-534)
DECLARE `A duty of the policyholder` IS ONE OF
    `to declare fully and truthfully what the insurer asks`                            -- (a)
    `to read and understand the terms`                                                 -- (b)
    `to pay premium in full and on time`                                               -- (c)
    `to notify circumstances that increase or reduce the risk`                         -- (d)
    `to notify the insured event and cooperate in the loss adjustment`                 -- (dd)
    `to take loss prevention and limitation measures`                                  -- (e)
    `another duty the law gives`                                                       -- (g)

-- Dieu 20(1)(d), 20(2)(dd), (e), (g), (i): how the insurer handled a claim.
@@q 456 458
@@q 478 488
@ref Dieu 20 (src:456-458; src:478-488)
DECLARE `An insurer's handling of a claim` HAS
    `the event is within the insurer's liability under the contract`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `an exclusion of liability in the contract applies`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer paid`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer refused to pay`                                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer explained the refusal in writing`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `a third person claimed compensation from the policyholder for a loss within the insurance liability` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer cooperated with the policyholder in settling the third person's claim` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer disclosed the policyholder's or insured person's information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a competent State body required the disclosure`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder or insured person agreed to the disclosure`            IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 21(2)(c), (d), (dd): how the policyholder performed.
@@q 521 531
@ref Dieu 21 (src:521-531)
DECLARE `The policyholder's conduct` HAS
    `premium was due`                                                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium was paid in full by the agreed time`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `a circumstance increasing or reducing the risk arose`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees the policyholder is to notify such a circumstance`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder notified the circumstance`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `an insured event occurred`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder notified the insured event as the contract agrees`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder cooperated in the loss adjustment`                     IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 22: what each side gave at formation.
@@q 535 559
@ref Dieu 22 (src:535-559)
DECLARE `The disclosure at formation` HAS
    `policyholder deliberately gave incomplete or false information to make the contract in order to be paid` IS A BOOLEAN
    `insurer deliberately failed to give, or gave false, information in order to make the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium paid`                                                           IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted`                    IS A NUMBER
    `damage the other side suffered`                                         IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 23: a change in the factors the premium is based on.
@@q 560 587
@ref Dieu 23 (src:560-587)
DECLARE `A change in the insured risk` HAS
    `the factors the premium is based on changed so that the insured risk fell`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the factors the premium is based on changed so that the insured risk rose`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract provides for adjustment on such a change`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer accepted the policyholder's request`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder accepted the insurer's request`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the terminating party notified the other immediately in writing`                 IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 23(1) and (3): what may be asked, what may be done, on a change of risk.
@@q 561 568
@@q 574 583
@ref Dieu 23 (src:561-568; src:574-583)
DECLARE `A request on a fall in the risk` IS ONE OF
    `reduce the premium for the remaining time`
    `increase the sum insured for the remaining time`
    `extend the insurance term`
    `widen the scope of insurance for the remaining time`

DECLARE `A measure on a rise in the risk` IS ONE OF
    `recalculate the premium for the remaining time`
    `reduce the sum insured for the remaining time`
    `shorten the insurance term`
    `narrow the scope of insurance for the remaining time`

-- Dieu 25(1): the grounds of voidness, as facts at the date the contract was made.
@@q 592 618
@ref Dieu 25 (src:592-618)
DECLARE `The formation of a contract` HAS
    `the policyholder had no insurable interest at the time of making`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `there was no object of insurance at the time of making`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder knew the insured event had already occurred`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the purpose or content violates a prohibition of law or social morality` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was a sham made by the insurer and the policyholder`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `a mistake meant a party or both could not achieve the purpose of the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the purpose has been achieved or the mistake can be cured at once so that the purpose is still achieved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was made as a result of deceit`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the deceit is the deliberate conduct dealt with in Dieu 22`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was made under threat or coercion`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder did not understand and control own conduct when making it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the form required by Dieu 18 was not observed`                          IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 26-27: a unilateral termination.
@@q 623 635
@ref Dieu 26 (src:623-635)
DECLARE `A ground for unilateral termination` IS ONE OF
    `premium not paid, or not paid in full, by the agreed time or after the grace period`
    `a request to change the insured risk under Dieu 23 was not accepted`
    `the insured person did not take the safety measures of Dieu 55(3)`
    `the policyholder did not agree to the transfer of the portfolio under Dieu 92(4)`

DECLARE `A party to the contract` IS ONE OF
    `the insurer`
    `the policyholder`

@@q 636 678
@ref Dieu 27 (src:636-678)
DECLARE `A unilateral termination` HAS
    `ground`                                                 IS A `A ground for unilateral termination`
    `terminating party`                                      IS A `A party to the contract`
    `date of termination`                                    IS A DATE
    `insured event occurred before termination`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium paid for the whole period up to termination`    IS A NUMBER
    `premium paid for the period after termination`          IS A NUMBER
    `premium due up to termination`                          IS A NUMBER
    `surrender value`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `the parties agreed otherwise on the surrender value`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract has a surrender value`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `value of the transferred assets`                        IS A NUMBER
    `technical reserve of the transferred portfolio`         IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 28: a transfer of the contract.
@@q 679 689
@ref Dieu 28 (src:679-689)
DECLARE `A transfer of a contract` HAS
    `the insured person or the insured person's legal representative agreed in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the transferee has an insurable interest`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer agreed in writing`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the transfer is made under international custom or by agreement in the contract` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 29: what the contract of reinsurance does not change.
@@q 690 703
@ref Dieu 29 (src:690-703)
DECLARE `A reinsurance in the background of a contract` HAS
    `the reinsurer did not meet its obligation to the insurer`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer refused or delayed performing for the policyholder`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the reinsurer asked the policyholder to pay premium directly to it`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder asked the reinsurer to pay the insurance money to it`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees otherwise`                                          IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 30-31, 46: a claim.
@@q 706 729
@ref Dieu 30-31 (src:706-729)
DECLARE `A claim` HAS
    `date of the insured event`                                              IS A DATE
    `days of force majeure or objective obstacle`                            IS A NUMBER
    `the claimant proves they did not know when the insured event occurred`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the insured person or beneficiary learned of the insured event`    IS A DATE
    `a third person claimed compensation from the policyholder`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of the third person's claim`                                       IS A DATE
    `date the claim dossier was submitted`                                   IS A DATE
    `date the insurer received the full and valid dossier`                   IS A DATE
    `date the insurer paid`                                                  IS A DATE
    `days agreed in the contract for payment`                                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `amount paid late`                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `daily interest rate agreed under the Civil Code`                        IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- Dieu 32: the way a dispute is resolved.
@@q 730 734
@ref Dieu 32 (src:730-734)
DECLARE `A forum for a dispute` IS ONE OF
    `mediation`
    `arbitration`
    `a court`

DECLARE `A dispute on a contract` HAS
    `the parties negotiated successfully`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `forum agreed in the contract`                           IS A MAYBE `A forum for a dispute`

§§ `Chuong II, Muc 2: life and health contracts`

-- Dieu 33, 43, 57: what each class of contract insures.
@@q 744 746
@@q 897 901
@@q 1077 1078
@ref Dieu 33, 43, 57 (src:744-746; src:897-901; src:1077-1078)
DECLARE `An object of insurance` IS ONE OF
    `the life span and the life of a human being`
    `the health of a human being`
    `property as the Civil Code defines it`
    `an economic interest or an obligation under a contract or by law that the insured person bears on a loss`
    `the civil liability of the insured person to a third person under the law`

-- Dieu 34(1): the policyholder's insurable interest in a life or health contract, as flags.
@@q 749 759
@ref Dieu 34 (src:749-759)
DECLARE `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` HAS
    `is the policyholder themself`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 35: the cooling-off period.
@@q 760 769
@ref Dieu 35 (src:760-769)
DECLARE `A decision to withdraw` HAS
    `date the policyholder received the contract`            IS A DATE
    `date the policyholder refused to continue`              IS A DATE
    `premium paid`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted`    IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 36: interim cover.
@@q 770 776
@ref Dieu 36 (src:770-776)
DECLARE `Interim cover` HAS
    `date the insurer received the request for insurance and the provisional premium` IS A DATE
    `date the insurer accepted or refused the insurance` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `other event the parties agreed ends the cover`          IS A MAYBE DATE

-- Dieu 37: paying life insurance premium.
@@q 777 791
@ref Dieu 37 (src:777-791)
DECLARE `The payment of life insurance premium` HAS
    `premium is paid by instalments`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `some instalments have been paid`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder cannot pay the next instalments`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the grace period began`                            IS A DATE
    `date the contract was terminated under Dieu 26(1)`      IS A DATE
    `date the parties agreed to restore the contract`        IS A DATE
    `the missing premium has been paid`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer deducted unpaid premium from the surrender value`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder agreed to the deduction`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer sued for the premium`                       IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 38-40: a death, an injury or an illness and who caused it.
@@q 792 840
@ref Dieu 38-40 (src:792-840)
DECLARE `A death or injury of the insured person` HAS
    `a third person caused it directly or indirectly`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person died by suicide`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of the first premium payment or of the restoration of the contract` IS A DATE
    `date of death`                                          IS A DATE
    `died through the deliberate fault of the policyholder`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `died through the deliberate fault of a beneficiary`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `suffered permanent disability through the insured person's own deliberate fault` IS A BOOLEAN
    `suffered permanent disability through the deliberate fault of the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN
    `suffered permanent disability through the deliberate fault of a beneficiary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `died by execution of a death sentence`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract excludes the case`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the beneficiary who caused it is one among several`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder is dead`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `surrender value or premium paid, less reasonable costs` IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 39: a contract on the death of another person.
@@q 803 814
@ref Dieu 39 (src:803-814)
DECLARE `A contract on the death of another` HAS
    `the person agreed in writing`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the writing states the sum insured and the beneficiary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `person`                                                 IS A `A person`
    `a parent or guardian agreed in writing`                 IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 41: designating and changing a beneficiary.
@@q 841 865
@ref Dieu 41 (src:841-865)
DECLARE `A designation of a beneficiary` HAS
    `is a group contract`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder is also the insured person`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person agreed in writing`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person is a minor or lacks or has limited capacity or has difficulty in cognition` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the legal representative agreed`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder notified the insurer in writing`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer confirmed in the contract or an attached document` IS A BOOLEAN
    `number of beneficiaries`                                IS A NUMBER
    `an order or proportions were fixed`                     IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 42: a group contract.
@@q 866 887
@ref Dieu 42 (src:866-887)
DECLARE `A group contract` HAS
    `the group was formed for a purpose other than taking part in insurance`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `at least one insured person is no longer a member of the group`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premium for an insured person was not paid as the contract agrees`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees another case for amending it`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the conditions of joining`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract states the conditions and procedure of converting to an individual contract` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Chuong II, Muc 3-4: property, damage and liability contracts`

-- Dieu 43-56: a property or damage contract and a loss under it.
@@q 895 916
@ref Dieu 43-45 (src:895-916)
DECLARE `A property or damage contract and a loss` HAS
    `sum insured`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `market value of the property at the time of making`     IS A NUMBER
    `market value of the property at the time and place of the loss` IS A NUMBER
    `actual loss`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `premium paid`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted`    IS A NUMBER
    `the policyholder is owner, holds another right in the property or possesses or uses it without owning` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder has a financial interest, financial obligation or liability, or economic loss in respect of the object` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder or insured person has the insurable interest at the time of the loss` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees otherwise on compensation`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the over-insurance was made deliberately`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the over-insurance was made through the policyholder's unintentional fault` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured event has occurred`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the loss is natural wear and tear or the inherent nature of the property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `costs reasonably and necessarily incurred to prevent and limit the loss` IS A NUMBER
    `costs the policyholder or insured person incurred in following the insurer's instructions` IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 49: the contracts in a double insurance.
@@q 964 973
@ref Dieu 49 (src:964-973)
DECLARE `A contract in a double insurance` HAS
    `sum insured`                                            IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `A double insurance` HAS
    `contracts`                                              IS A LIST OF `A contract in a double insurance`
    `market value of the property at the time of making`     IS A NUMBER
    `actual loss`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `the contracts cover the same scope, object, term and insured event` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 46: notice of the insured event.
@@q 917 932
@ref Dieu 46 (src:917-932)
DECLARE `A notice of the insured event` HAS
    `the policyholder notified within the time the contract agrees`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle prevented timely notice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees the policyholder's responsibility and the sanctions for failing or delaying to notify` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the loss the insurer bears because of the failure or delay`     IS A NUMBER
    `compensation otherwise payable`                                 IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 52: the form of compensation.
@@q 997 1010
@ref Dieu 52 (src:997-1010)
DECLARE `A form of compensation` IS ONE OF
    `repair of the damaged property`
    `replacement of the damaged property by other property`
    `payment of compensation in money`

DECLARE `A form agreed for compensation` HAS
    `form agreed`                                            IS A MAYBE `A form of compensation`
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 53-54: loss adjustment and recourse.
@@q 1011 1049
@ref Dieu 53-54 (src:1011-1049)
DECLARE `A loss adjustment and recourse` HAS
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract provides otherwise`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `a third person is liable for the loss`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that person deliberately caused the loss`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `compensation paid`                                      IS A NUMBER

-- Dieu 55: safety measures.
@@q 1050 1064
@ref Dieu 55 (src:1050-1064)
DECLARE `A safety measure` HAS
    `the insured person failed to take the safety measures` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer fixed a time for taking them`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the time has expired and they are still not taken`     IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 57-61: a liability contract.
@@q 1076 1124
@ref Dieu 57-61 (src:1076-1124)
DECLARE `A liability contract and a claim` HAS
    `a third person claimed compensation from the insured person`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act causing the damage occurred within the insurance term` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the third person's claim was made within the insurance term` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the third person claims directly from the insurer`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the law provides that the third person may claim directly`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `amount the insured person must pay the third person by law`   IS A NUMBER
    `costs of resolving the dispute on liability to the third person` IS A NUMBER
    `interest payable to the third person for the insured person's late payment as the insurer directed` IS A NUMBER
    `limit of liability`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `the contract agrees otherwise on the limit`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person must post a bond or deposit to keep the property from detention or to avoid a suit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person asks the insurer to give the bond or deposit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract so agrees`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer negotiates with the third person for the insured person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees otherwise on representation`             IS A BOOLEAN
